<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Help Center | Emergence-Connect</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #050d1f;
      --navy-2: #0a1833;
      --gold: #c9a84c;
      --gold-dim: #7a5f20;
      --cream: #f2eedf;
      --cream-dim: #cdc8b4;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --border: rgba(201,168,76,0.18);
      --radius: 20px;
      --radius-sm: 12px;
    }
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
    body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;background:radial-gradient(circle at top left,rgba(37,99,176,0.22),transparent 26%),radial-gradient(circle at bottom right,rgba(201,168,76,0.15),transparent 24%),var(--navy);color:var(--cream);}
    body::before{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");opacity:0.3;}
    img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
    a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
    .container{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:0 auto;}
    .site-shell{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:24px;padding:32px 0 48px;}
    .masthead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:20px 0;}
    .brand{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:var(--gold);}
    .page-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:32px;backdrop-filter:blur(16px);box-shadow:0 24px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);}
    .page-title{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:clamp(2rem,3.5vw,2.6rem);margin-bottom:12px;}
    .page-subtitle{color:var(--cream-dim);margin-bottom:28px;line-height:1.7;}
    .button,.button-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease,background .2s ease;}
    .button{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold-dim),var(--gold));color:var(--navy);}
    .button-secondary{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-color:var(--border);color:var(--cream);}
    .button:hover,.button-secondary:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);}
    .grid{display:grid;gap:20px;}
    .help-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));}
    .help-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:24px;}
    .help-card h3{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:1rem;}
    .help-card p{color:var(--cream-dim);line-height:1.65;}
    .help-contact{display:grid;gap:18px;margin-top:24px;}
    .help-contact dt{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--gold);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-bottom:6px;}
    .help-contact dd{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--cream-dim);line-height:1.8;}
    .footer-strip{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:12px;color:rgba(242,238,223,.72);}
    @media(max-width:800px){.masthead{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}.page-card{padding:24px;}.help-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  </style>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container site-shell">
    <header class="masthead">
      <a class="brand" href="/index">Emergence-Connect</a>
      <div>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/index">Home</a>
        <a class="button" href="/login">Sign In</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="page-card">
      <h1 class="page-title">Help Center</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Find answers to common questions or reach out to our support team for assistance with registration, document submissions, and account access.</p>

      <div class="grid help-grid">
        <article class="help-card">
          <h3>Login Support</h3>
          <p>Need help accessing your account? Learn about biometric verification, PIN login, and secure gateway access.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="help-card">
          <h3>Document Requests</h3>
          <p>Submit a new certificate request, track current applications, and review document eligibility requirements.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="help-card">
          <h3>Security & Privacy</h3>
          <p>Understand how your data is protected and what measures are in place for secure digital identity management.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="help-card">
          <h3>Technical Assistance</h3>
          <p>Report browser issues, accessibility concerns, or problems with camera-based authentication.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <section class="help-contact">
        <div>
          <dt>Contact Email</dt>
          <dd>support@emergence-connect.gov</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Phone</dt>
          <dd>+1 (800) 555-0124</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Service Hours</dt>
          <dd>Mon - Fri, 08:00 - 18:00</dd>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer-strip">
      <a href="/civil-status">Civil Status</a>
      <a href="/login">Back to Login</a>
      <a href="/index">Home</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
